    <string name="parent_npu_title">Try the Edge TPU for the model</string>
    <string name="parent_npu_hint">Attempts the phone’s AI chip before the GPU. On a Pixel 9 this may hang the load, crash the app once, or leave it running on the CPU at a fifth the speed. Check logcat for the NPU line, then turn it back off.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title">Welcome! What\'s your English level?</string>
    <string name="onboarding_hint">Level 1 to 7, for any age — it sets how Tuki talks and how much Hebrew help appears. You can change it any time in the Parent Zone.</string>
